  "policy": "ratchet",
  "_comment": "Single source of truth for gated signal-quality metrics. Gate = no-worse-than (baseline +/- epsilon), per metric direction. Epsilon absorbs small-sample noise (~one event flip on the 20-event set). Lowering a baseline is an explicit reviewed edit with a rationale (see docs/evaluation/08). Improvements may ratchet a baseline up. Enforced by scripts/assertBaseline.ts; metrics with gated=false are recorded in the registry but not yet enforced.",
